OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRemaining windy and showery,
OL,6,Fthe showers heavy with the risk of the
OL,7,Fodd thunderstorm. Showers quite
OL,8,Ffrequent in the morning with a few
OL,9,Fdrier and sunnier spells developing in
OL,10,Fthe afternoon. Fresh to strong
OL,11,Fwesterly winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FScattered and occasionally
OL,14,Fheavy showers in the evening, becoming
OL,15,Flighter and more isolated overnight
OL,16,Fwith some clear spells developing.
OL,17,FStrong westerly winds in the evening
OL,18,Fwill start to ease overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
