OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,6,Fa few showers. Breezy to start but
OL,7,Fwinds becoming light through the day.
OL,8,FSome patchy rain may spread north
OL,9,Flater in the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,12,Fwith rain on Sunday morning and again
OL,13,Flater in the day. Bright start Monday
OL,14,Fthen increasingly heavy showers and
OL,15,Fstrong winds. Windy Tuesday with
OL,16,Foccasionally heavy rain or showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
